      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Would not recommend Ozeal Energy – very poor post-sale serviceWe had solar installed through Ozeal based on a referral, but the experience has been disappointing. What we were promised (10.56 KW system) wasn’t what was delivered (10.12 KW), and some features of the monitoring app we were shown during the demo require a $500 extra meter — which was never mentioned at the time of sale.Their installation engineer (certified electrician) advised me on a call that it could be a miss from their end and said they’d cover 50% of the cost and arrange installation — but despite repeated follow-ups, nothing’s been done. Their last message was that the issue was being reviewed... and it’s been over a month with no update.We trusted them, but their service has fallen far short. I’ll be taking this further with consumer authorities. If you’re exploring solar providers, I’d suggest you also explore other more transparent and reliable options.",
